			"notes": "Initial release. From the [README](https://github.com/qixils/antisocial#readme):\n\n> A simple utility mod that adds a keybind to toggle on and off the rendering of other players. Hides player models, sprint particles, and all nameplates (including non-player entities, since they are often used on modded servers for colored usernames).\n\nSupports Fabric 1.19+. Depends only on [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api)."
